"轴的角度。[#f3]_ :math:`\\Gamma` 称为分配矩阵。"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:68
#: 2914490cbe394e91bfad21d651de4997
msgid ""
"These equations are non-linear, interdependent and hard to use. Most control"
" system analysis and tools are based on simpler linear or linearized "
"systems. Because of this, the equations of motion are linearized around the "
"stationary hover state by looking at small disturbances of the state "
"variables and inputs. This assumes that the parameter "
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO<MOT_THST_EXPO>` has been :ref:`set correctly<motor-"
"thrust-scaling>`."
msgstr ""
"这些方程是非线性的、相互依赖的，难以直接使用。大多数控制系统分析和工具基于更简单的线性或线性化系统。因此，通过分析状态变量和输入的小扰动，将运动方程在稳定悬停状态附近线性化。这假设参数"
" :ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO<MOT_THST_EXPO>` 已 :ref:`正确设置<motor-thrust-scaling>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:73
#: fb331e69e1d0406780cb88c90a3352aa
msgid ""
"As an example, the lateral velocity :math:`u` can then be expressed by its "
"stationary condition :math:`u_0` and its perturbation :math:`\\Delta u`"
msgstr "例如，横向速度 :math:`u` 可以用其稳态值 :math:`u_0` 和扰动量 :math:`\\Delta u` 表示"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:77
#: 01ac8585a21e46379e077ff2fa2afc46
msgid "Small perturbation equation"
msgstr "小扰动方程"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:79
#: 945e514f396e400293ead66730fb7b77
msgid ""
"While hovering, the stationary condition of every state and input quantity "
"is 0, since there is no translational or rotational motion of the vehicle. "
"[#f4]_ The equations of motion can then be simplified to"
msgstr "在悬停状态下，每个状态和输入量的稳态值均为 0，因为飞行器没有平移或旋转运动。[#f4]_ 运动方程可以简化为"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:84
#: 3c2bb711b76a4337a166eb741f432580
msgid "Linearized motion equations"
msgstr "线性化运动方程"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:86
#: 6c9712fd05b947759532877c0d388181
msgid ""
"This linearization removes the interdependencies between the pitch, roll and"
" yaw motions of the copter, thereby yielding three decoupled systems. Next, "
"the perturbations in each force and torque are modeled to obtain the "
"influences of these system inputs on the state variables. By using a Taylor "
"series expansion, the forces and torques are described as a linear function "
"of the disturbances in the state and input variables that they depend on. "
"The coefficients of each state variable are the so-called stability or "
"control derivatives of the respective force and torque. [#f4]_ [#f5]_"
msgstr ""
"这种线性化消除了飞机俯仰、横滚和偏航运动之间的相互依赖关系，从而得到三个解耦的系统。接下来，对每个力和力矩中的扰动进行建模，以获得这些系统输入对状态变量的影响。通过使用泰勒级数展开，将力和力矩描述为其所依赖的状态变量和输入变量扰动的线性函数。每个状态变量的系数称为相应力和力矩的稳定性或控制导数。[#f4]_"
" [#f5]_"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:93
#: 57d8a81c0b75466781f3be87f9848ef5
msgid "Perturbed forces torque equations"
msgstr "扰动力矩方程"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:95
#: 1fe73957235247e59ead205d07ea7e8e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"By inserting these descriptions of forces and torques, the linearized "
"equations of motion are rewritten in a state-space representation, with the "
"control forces :math:`F_{c}` and torques :math:`M_{c}` generated by the "
"propellers being the model inputs. Since only perturbed quantities are "
"contained in the equations, the :math:`\\Delta` indicating the small "
"perturbations is left out."
msgstr ""
"通过代入这些力和力矩的描述，线性化运动方程被改写为状态空间表示形式，以螺旋桨产生的控制力 :math:`F_{c}` 和力矩 :math:`M_{c}`"
" 作为模型输入。由于方程中只包含扰动量，表示小扰动的 :math:`\\Delta` 符号被省略。"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:101
#: ef9d56e3ec8f41ce8ebb71f7ddc70ac6
msgid ""
"The actual control inputs of the system are the rate controller outputs as "
"shown in the :ref:`Control System Diagram<control_system_diagram>`. The "
"motor mixer converts the controller outputs to thrust demands for each "
"motor. The motor model describes the transfer function from mixer outputs to"
" control forces and torques that are acting on the airframe. The motors are "
"not able to instantly realize the mixer demands. Instead, they have their "
"own dynamic which needs to be modeled. For this purpose, it is assumed that "
"the relation between thrust demand and provided voltage to the motors by the"
" ESC is proportional. The transfer from motor voltage to angular motor speed"
" is modeled by a first-order system. [#f2]_ Apart from that, it is necessary"
" to model the relation between voltage and motor torque that equals the "
"reaction torque of the propulsion unit :math:`Q_i`. The equation for "
":math:`Q_i` in the :ref:`Thrust reaction torque "
"equations<fig_eq_thrust_torque>` only models the stationary reaction torque "
"of the propeller. The acceleration or deceleration of the motor leads to an "
"additional, dynamic reaction torque due to the inertia of the motor. [#f3]_ "
"The transfer function can then be written as"
msgstr ""
"系统的实际控制输入是如 :ref:`控制系统框图<control_system_diagram>` "
"所示的速率控制器输出。电机混控器将控制器输出转换为每个电机的推力需求。电机模型描述了从混控器输出到作用于机架的控制力和力矩的传递函数。电机无法瞬间实现混控器的需求，而是有其自身的动态特性，需要进行建模。为此，假设推力需求与"
" ESC 向电机提供的电压成正比。从电机电压到电机角速度的传递用一阶系统建模。[#f2]_ 此外，还需要对电压与电机扭矩（即推进装置的反应扭矩 "
":math:`Q_i`）之间的关系进行建模。:ref:`推力反应扭矩方程<fig_eq_thrust_torque>` 中的 :math:`Q_i` "
"方程只描述了螺旋桨的稳态反应扭矩。由于电机惯量，电机的加速或减速会产生额外的动态反应扭矩。[#f3]_ 传递函数可以写成"

