msgstr "控制器输出到推力指令"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:125
#: 7e9ae8ba35c44db08f7dd41ff9e18897
msgid ""
"As a consequence, the inverted matrix above and the :ref:`allocation "
"matrix<fig-eq-force-torque-prop>` cancel each other out, thereby leaving the"
" following four separate control paths: heave, roll, pitch and yaw. The "
"motor dynamics are incorporated in these models by using the :ref:`transfer "
"functions<fig-eq-motor-model>` as a relation between the controller outputs "
"and the generated force or torque acting on the respective axis. To model "
"this in a state-space representation, control forces and torques are added "
"to the states of the system. [#f6]_ The state-space models for the roll, "
"pitch and yaw axis are formulated as"
msgstr ""
"因此，上述逆矩阵与 :ref:`分配矩阵<fig-eq-force-torque-prop>` "
"相互抵消，从而产生以下四条独立的控制路径：升沉、横滚、俯仰和偏航。电机动态通过使用 :ref:`传递函数<fig-eq-motor-model>` "
"作为控制器输出与作用于相应轴的生成力或力矩之间的关系，被纳入这些模型。为了在状态空间表示中对此进行建模，将控制力和力矩添加到系统的状态中。[#f6]_ "
"横滚、俯仰和偏航轴的状态空间模型表示为"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:134
#: d644e6f541d94a349aa0eee7273f2242
msgid "Axis models"
msgstr "轴模型"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:136
#: 83e35b344f1e42d2ba4f043f26a3d527
msgid ""
"The used transfer function model of each axis is derived from the state-"
"space models above through Laplace-Transformation and by solving for the "
"angular velocities :math:`p`, :math:`q` and :math:`r` as the outputs of each"
" model. For simplicity, generic coefficients are used. Also, dead time terms"
" are added to account for delays, that were not regarded in the modeling. "
"[#f6]_ These three transfer functions represent the model structures used in"
" the identification of the pitch, roll and yaw axes."
msgstr ""
"每个轴所使用的传递函数模型通过对上述状态空间模型进行拉普拉斯变换，并求解各模型输出的角速度 :math:`p`、:math:`q` 和 "
":math:`r` 得到。为简化起见，使用了通用系数。此外，还添加了纯延迟项以考虑建模中未涉及的延迟。[#f6]_ "
"这三个传递函数代表了用于辨识俯仰、横滚和偏航轴的模型结构。"

