#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:223
#: b6b5fafdd7b14efdbb5827049c8e3f52
msgid ""
"The frequency response of each axis is obtained through spectral analysis of"
" the flight data. Only test flights with sufficient coherence between input "
"and output are used for the system identification. To increase the accuracy "
"of the resulting plant model and to compensate for process errors, multiple "
"flights for each axis are performed and an averaged frequency response is "
"computed. The following diagrams show the data-based frequency responses of "
"all three axes. The bottom plot shows the coherence between input and output"
" which quantifies the linearity between input and output."
msgstr ""
"通过对飞行数据进行频谱分析得到每个轴的频率响应。只有输入和输出之间具有足够相干性的测试飞行才用于系统辨识。为提高被控对象模型的精度并补偿过程误差，每个轴进行多次飞行，并计算平均频率响应。以下图表显示了三个轴基于数据的频率响应，底部图形显示输入和输出之间的相干性，用于量化输入和输出之间的线性度。"

