#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:268
#: 1e860c79232e4548b0b7814a764e00d7
msgid "Example of Identification Results and Model Verification"
msgstr "辨识结果与模型验证示例"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:270
#: dbe2115faf644b5faf712c5290b05768
msgid ""
"The system of a quadcopter is inherently unstable. Slight modeling errors or"
" unconsidered external inputs of the real system lead to divergence of the "
"axis models [#f7]_. Since a model does never fully reproduce the behavior of"
" the real system, the model validation is conducted in closed-loop with the "
"same stabilize controller used during the test flights. For the validation "
"test runs, the closed-loop model is given the same input signals that were "
"given to the real system, which are the references for the stabilize "
"controller (desired angle or rate in case of the yaw axis). The outputs of "
"the models, namely the angular rates, are then compared to the measured "
"system outputs during real flight. First, it is examined if the models "
"reproduce the test signals, i.e. the frequency-sweeps. The desired angles of"
" the stabilize controller are set to zero and the sweeps are directly added "
"to the output of the rate controllers."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼系统本质上是不稳定的。实际系统中轻微的建模误差或未考虑的外部输入会导致轴模型发散 "
"[#f7]_。由于模型永远无法完全复现真实系统的行为，模型验证在闭环中进行，使用与测试飞行相同的稳定控制器。在验证测试中，闭环模型接收与真实系统相同的输入信号，即稳定控制器的参考输入（期望角度，或偏航轴的期望速率）。模型输出（即角速度）随后与真实飞行中测量到的系统输出进行比较。首先检验模型是否能够复现测试信号（即频率扫描）。稳定控制器的期望角度设为零，扫描信号直接叠加到速率控制器的输出上。"

