#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:294
#: e60ffd31a17944b8aea9c472fa336b63
msgid ""
"Since the frequency-sweeps are used for the identification, it is important "
"to test the models against another test signal to check for their "
"robustness. A widely recommended verification signal is the so-called "
"doublet maneuver which is a double step [#f8]_. For time-domain validation, "
"a similar signal is used as the input of the stabilize controller. As shown "
"in the following figure, it consists of two consecutive doublet maneuvers."
msgstr ""
"由于频率扫描用于辨识，因此用另一种测试信号来检验模型的鲁棒性非常重要。广泛推荐的验证信号是所谓的双脉冲机动（doublet "
"maneuver），即双阶跃信号 [#f8]_。对于时域验证，使用类似信号作为稳定控制器的输入。如下图所示，该信号由两个连续的双脉冲机动组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/systemid-model-development.rst:301
#: c0bbf4c5f1a0425fa1fa83362adef2e5
msgid "Model validation doublet"
msgstr "模型验证双脉冲"

